cs#2-做明确责任和验收方式","content":"用 Issue 记录范围、区域或设备编号、负责人、预算或影响、成功标准和相关证据。涉及重要取舍时，建立或关联决策记录。"},"54":{"id":"/docs-52","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs#3-记让文档与现场重新一致","content":"完成实施或评审后，更新对应方案、图纸、设备台账和验收记录，关联 Issue 与测试证据。每页标题下方的 GitHub 入口可直接打开源 MDX 文件。"},"55":{"id":"/docs-53","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs#3-记让文档与现场重新一致","content":"查结论，看文档；推任务，建 Issue；改结论，提 Pull Request；做了重要取舍，补决策记录。"},"56":{"id":"/docs/guide/architecture","page_id":"/docs/guide/architecture","type":"page","content":"当前网络现状","breadcrumbs":["Docs","规划与协作"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide/architecture"},"57":{"id":"/docs/guide/architecture-0","page_id":"/docs/guide/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/architecture","content":"AI实验室当前贵阳—遵义网络架构、链路、VLAN 和策略路由关系，作为后续改造与排障基线。"},"58":{"id":"/docs/guide/architecture-1","page_id":"/docs/guide/architecture","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide/architecture#当前网络架构","content":"当前网络架构"},"59":{"id":"/docs/guide/architecture-2","page_id":"/docs/guide/architecture","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide/architecture#贵阳网络摘要","content":"贵阳网络摘要"},"60":{"id":"/docs/guide/architecture-3","page_id":"/docs/guide/architecture","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide/architecture#遵义互联","content":"遵义互联"},"61":{"id":"/docs/guide/architecture-4","page_id":"/docs/guide/architecture","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide/architecture#运维约束","content":"运维约束"},"62":{"id":"/docs/guide/architecture-5","page_id":"/docs/guide/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/architecture","content":"本页记录已经在运行的网络基线，用于改造前核对和故障排查；如果你要规划新增布线、VLAN 或智能化网络，请转到网络与弱电规划。"},"63":{"id":"/docs/guide/architecture-6","page_id":"/docs/guide/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/architecture#当前网络架构","content":"文档页展示的是概览图，源文件位于 `public/network-overview.mmd`；完整的实际拓扑保留在 `public/network-architecture.mmd`，仅作为配置与排障时的技术参考。"},"64":{"id":"/docs/guide/architecture-7","page_id":"/docs/guide/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/architecture#贵阳网络摘要","content":"**边界与出口**：CCR1009（`192.168.99.1`，RouterOS 7.19.3）承担网关、DHCP、DNS、防火墙和策略路由；三路 PPPoE 为主出口，200M 静态专线（VLAN 214）为备用出口及公网入站。"},"65":{"id":"/docs/guide/architecture-8","page_id":"/docs/guide/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/architecture#贵阳网络摘要","content":"**交换与无线**：CCR 与 H3C SW1 通过 `bond-sw1` 的四链路 LACP 互联；SW1 分别与 SW2、SW3 使用四链路 LACP Trunk；爱快 AP 接入 SW1 `GE1/0/43` Trunk。"},"66":{"id":"/docs/guide/architecture-9","page_id":"/docs/guide/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/architecture#贵阳网络摘要","content":"**网段**：Office/RD 为 VLAN 10（`192.168.10.0/23`），IoT 为 VLAN 20（`192.168.20.0/23`），管理网为 VLAN 99（`192.168.99.0/24`）。"},"67":{"id":"/docs/guide/architecture-10","page_id":"/docs/guide/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/architecture#贵阳网络摘要","content":"**策略出口**：Arch Linux 旁路由（`192.168.10.62`）通过 Hysteria TProxy 处理非 CN、`rhzy.ai` 与远端私网的 TCP/UDP 策略路由；公网 `:443` 入站 DNAT 到后端时，经旁路由保持对称回程。"},"68":{"id":"/docs/guide/architecture-11","page_id":"/docs/guide/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/architecture#遵义互联","content":"遵义侧使用 CCR1072（RouterOS 7.23.2），承载本地 WireGuard 与 LAN/OVPN 网段。两地通过 GRE 连接，公网端点已脱敏，隧道地址为 `172.16.1.2` 与 `172.16.1.3`。"},"69":{"id":"/docs/guide/architecture-12","page_id":"/docs/guide/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/architecture#运维约束","content":"VLAN 10、20、99 的端口成员、Trunk 的 tagged/native 设置和 LACP 对端必须与图表保持一致。"},"70":{"id":"/docs/guide/architecture-13","page_id":"/docs/guide/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/architecture#运维约束","content":"每次变更路由标记、NAT、Hysteria 或 GRE 配置后，应验证远端私网与公网入站的对称回程。"},"71":{"id":"/docs/guide/architecture-14","page_id":"/docs/guide/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/architecture#运维约束","content":"CCR、交换机、旁路由的配置备份与恢复步骤必须关联到变更记录，且不得提交密码、私钥或令牌。"},"72":{"id":"/docs/guide/architecture-15","page_id":"/docs/guide/architecture","tags":[],"type":